<title>UK: Ashanti ups gold resource at Geita area.</title>
<headline>Ashanti ups gold resource at Geita area.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashanti Goldfields Co Ltd Co Ltd raised its gold resource estimate for the Geita property in northern Tanzania to 3.0 million ounces, which is 128 percent more than previously reported.</p>
<p>The increase follows a new drilling programme which showed a measured, indicated and inferred resource of 32.6 million tonnes grading 2.82 grammes per tonne, Ashanti said.</p>
<p>After these &quot;encouraging&quot; results, the Ghanaian mining company has now started a second phase drilling programme at Geita.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
